s/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-9096ff45549bdd14END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-29af084c094c2f55END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_GEN_FablesofFaerun3</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_GEN_FablesofFaerun3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_GEN_FablesofFaerun3\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">d5ec3a05-e479-4ee4-9803-b17ff55bfa1d</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:d5ec3a05-e479-4ee4-9803-b17ff55bfa1d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:d5ec3a05-e479-4ee4-9803-b17ff55bfa1d\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the <a href=\"/wiki/Tiefling_Hideout\" title=\"Tiefling Hideout\">Tiefling Hideout</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;87&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;73</span></li>\n<li>In the basement of <a href=\"/wiki/Old_Garlow%27s_Place\" title=\"Old Garlow's Place\">Old Garlow's Place</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;799&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;746</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>There were once two sisters, one a great <a href=\"/wiki/Fighter\" title=\"Fighter\">fighter</a> and one a great <a href=\"/wiki/Cleric\" title=\"Cleric\">cleric</a>, who longed for new adventure.\n</p><p><br>\n'I shall skewer an <a href=\"/wiki/Elder_Brain\" title=\"Elder Brain\">elder brain</a> upon my sword!' cried the fighter. 'To the <a href=\"/wiki/Underdark\" title=\"Underdark\">Underdark</a>!'\n</p><p><br>\n'I wish to know the secrets of the brain's powers', said the cleric. 'Let us be off!'\n</p><p><br>\nIn the recesses of the deep, the sisters slayed darklings and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Derro\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"derro\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Derro\">derro</a></span>, <a href=\"/wiki/Bugbear\" title=\"Bugbear\">bugbears</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Bulette\" title=\"Bulette\">bulettes</a>. The two reached an illithid colony when the fourth tenday passed. Their quest would soon be complete.\n</p><p><br>\nWith great effort, they felled a half-dozen <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_flayer\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mind flayer\">mind flayers</a> and soon reached the elder brain's lair. It rose from the brine pool at the center of its chamber, flanked by illithids. The brain didn't speak aloud, but the sisters could hear it in their minds.\n</p><p><br>\n'I am called Qaoz. Why have you come?'\n</p><p><br>\n'I will make your powers my own', called the cleric.\n</p><p><br>\n'I will crush you and bring an end to your tyranny', said the fighter.\n</p><p><br>\nThe brain hovered in silence. A moment later, a burst of psionic energy shook the chamber, and the sisters lay dead.\n</p><p><br>\n'Good luck,' Qaoz replied. The illithids feasted heartily that day.\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>See also:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fables_of_Faer%C3%BBn_I:_The_Dimwitted_Drow\" title=\"Fables of Faerûn I: The Dimwitted Drow\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6c/Book_Tome_R_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_R_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6c/Book_Tome_R_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Tome_R_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6c/Book_Tome_R_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Tome_R_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6c/Book_Tome_R_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_R_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6c/Book_Tome_R_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Fables_of_Faer%C3%BBn_I:_The_Dimwitted_Drow\" title=\"Fables of Faerûn I: The Dimwitted Drow\">Fables of Faerûn I: The 